# Pattern Along Path (an extension): with nothing selected it says what
# to select; with the construction line of path_pattern_path picked, the
# post is repeated three times along it, and the group screen lists the
# copies and the path. Analyze > Check Solid finds the three posts.
key c
move 200 300
down L 200 300
up L 200 300
move 210 300
down L 210 300
up L 210 300
key esc
key s
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 400 200
down L 400 200
up L 400 200
key esc
key esc
move 300 200
down L 300 200
up L 300 200
key g
key esc
key x shift
answer ok
menu New Group|Pattern Along Path
move 300 200
down L 300 200
up L 300 200
menu New Group|Pattern Along Path
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
